## Key Changes
### 1. Advanced Visibility Controls
Instructors can now toggle individual lessons, entire sections, or the whole course to "Inactive". This hides content from students while allowing instructors to continue editing in the background.

### 2. Safeguarded Deletion
All deletions are now "Soft Deletes," meaning data is preserved in the database with a `deleted_at` timestamp, preventing accidental data loss while keeping the UI clean.

### 3. Real-Time Media Previews
The new interactive sidebar in the lesson editor allows instructors to instantly see how their videos (YouTube/Vimeo/Direct) or PDFs will appear to students.

